# Local change 2 of 2, applied after clipboard-boundary.patch (spice-client ADR-0004).
#
# Bounds the monitors-configuration send window with a deadline. Upstream closes
# the window only on VD_AGENT_REPLY; QEMU's virtio-gpu path consumes the message
# in client_monitors_config and never replies, so the first resize latched the
# sender for the life of the agent connection and every later resize was dropped
# while the session still advertised monitor configuration.
